{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓劇《財閥家的小兒子》宋仲基2023年與《絹戀》英國女星姬蒂桑德斯（Katy Louise Saunders）奉子再婚，同年誕下兒子，前年再得一女，剛巧湊成「好」字。</p><p>然而網上瘋傳宋仲基與姬蒂婚變，爆出第二度離婚的傳聞。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:25:52.611326+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:53:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:18:23.210197+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:20.235465+00:00","content_hash":"799a8753e5c35a3556410d16a4aa48381bb8a249fe191371ac991552da6daf88","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}